### RABADON_OFF=1
    rabadon: SILENT — silenced; the gate returns 0 before any rule runs
      silenced by: RABADON_OFF=1 (environment variable)
        next: unset RABADON_OFF
      read from: <RABADON_DIR>/mode (not consulted — a silencer above answers first)
    -> real gate: exit=0 bytes=0  (SILENT iff exit=0 and bytes=0)

### <project>/.rabadon/off
    rabadon: SILENT — silenced; the gate returns 0 before any rule runs
      silenced by: .rabadon/off (<project>/.rabadon/off)
        next: rm <project>/.rabadon/off
      read from: <RABADON_DIR>/mode (not consulted — a silencer above answers first)
    -> real gate: exit=0 bytes=0  (SILENT iff exit=0 and bytes=0)

### $RABADON_DIR/silent  (entered via the product`s own `rabadon-gate --silent`)
    rabadon: SILENT — silenced; the gate returns 0 before any rule runs
      silenced by: silent (<RABADON_DIR>/silent)
        next: rabadon off
      read from: <RABADON_DIR>/mode (present)
    -> real gate: exit=0 bytes=0  (SILENT iff exit=0 and bytes=0)

### $RABADON_DIR/mode = silent
    rabadon: SILENT — silenced; the gate returns 0 before any rule runs
      silenced by: mode = silent (<RABADON_DIR>/mode)
        next: rabadon off
      read from: <RABADON_DIR>/mode (present)
    -> real gate: exit=0 bytes=0  (SILENT iff exit=0 and bytes=0)

### <project>/.rabadon/mode = silent
    rabadon: SILENT — silenced; the gate returns 0 before any rule runs
      silenced by: .rabadon/mode = silent (<project>/.rabadon/mode)
        next: rm <project>/.rabadon/mode
      read from: <project>/.rabadon/mode (present)
    -> real gate: exit=0 bytes=0  (SILENT iff exit=0 and bytes=0)

### RABADON_MODE=silent
    rabadon: SILENT — silenced; the gate returns 0 before any rule runs
      silenced by: RABADON_MODE=silent (environment variable)
        next: unset RABADON_MODE
      read from: RABADON_MODE (environment variable)
    -> real gate: exit=0 bytes=0  (SILENT iff exit=0 and bytes=0)

